{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'EDP RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA LLC AND CONNECTGEN LLC ACQUIRED 278 MW SOLAR PORTFOLIO LOCATED IN THE U.S. FROM FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQGS:FSLR).', 'text': 'EDP RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA LLC AND CONNECTGEN LLC ACQUIRED 278 MW SOLAR PORTFOLIO LOCATED IN THE U.S. FROM FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQGS:FSLR) ON OCTOBER 28, 2019. EDP - ENERGIAS DE PORTUGAL, S.A. (ENXTLS:EDP), PARENT OF EDP RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA LLC EXPECTS TO MAKE A TOTAL NET EQUITY INVESTMENT IN THE PORTFOLIO OF APPROXIMATELY $150 MILLION FOR THE FULL CONSTRUCTION AND NET OF THE EXPECTED TAX EQUITY FINANCING. LANCE BRASHER AND ETHAN SCHULTZ OF SKADDEN, ARPS, SLATE, MEAGHER & FLOM LLP ACTED AS LEGAL ADVISORS FOR FIRST SOLAR, INC.\nEDP RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA LLC AND CONNECTGEN LLC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF 278 MW SOLAR PORTFOLIO LOCATED IN THE U.S. FROM FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQGS:FSLR) ON OCTOBER 28, 2019. THE PORTFOLIO CONSISTS OF THREE PLANTS LOCATED IN ARIZONA, CALIFORNIA AND NEVADA, EACH OF WHICH IS FULLY CONTRACTED UNDER LONG-TERM POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENTS AND EXPECTED TO ACHIEVE COMMERCIAL OPERATIONS IN THE NEXT FEW MONTHS.\n'}